{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27281899","formula":"C₁₁H₇Cl₂F₃N₂O","hill":"C11H7Cl2F3N2O","elements":["H","C","N","O","F","Cl"],"composition":{"C":11.0,"F":3.0,"H":7.0,"N":2.0,"O":1.0,"Cl":2.0},"names":{"en":"JNJ-37654032"},"descriptions":{"en":"JNJ-37654032 is a selective androgen receptor modulator (SARM) which was developed by Johnson & Johnson for the potential treatment of muscular atrophy but was never marketed. The drug is a nonsteroidal androgen receptor (AR) modulator with mixed agonistic (androgenic) and antagonistic (antiandrogenic) effects. In animals, it has shown full agonist-like effects in muscle, agonistic suppressive effects on follicle-stimulating hormone (FSH) secretion, and antagonistic or partially agonistic effects in the prostate."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":23729483,"mass":311.08,"charge":0,"smiles":"C=CC(C1=NC2=CC(=C(C=C2N1)Cl)Cl)(C(F)(F)F)O","inchikey":"HEDZSNUSVHSSQI-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2-(5,6-dichloro-1H-benzimidazol-2-yl)-1,1,1-trifluorobut-3-en-2-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"23729483","atoms":26,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-4.969,"y":1.804,"z":0.356,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-5.219,"y":-1.388,"z":-0.019,"el":"Cl"},{"x":2.565,"y":-0.938,"z":1.86,"el":"F"},{"x":4.299,"y":-0.061,"z":0.882,"el":"F"},{"x":2.59,"y":1.192,"z":1.401,"el":"F"},{"x":2.687,"y":-1.69,"z":-0.744,"el":"O"},{"x":0.13,"y":0.897,"z":-0.124,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.035,"y":-1.304,"z":-0.382,"el":"N"},{"x":2.261,"y":-0.33,"z":-0.429,"el":"C"},{"x":0.791,"y":-0.284,"z":-0.317,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.212,"y":0.621,"z":-0.061,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.288,"y":-0.759,"z":-0.225,"el":"C"},{"x":2.948,"y":-0.025,"z":0.936,"el":"C"},{"x":2.862,"y":0.49,"z":-1.595,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.33,"y":1.435,"z":0.119,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.548,"y":-1.381,"z":-0.211,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.576,"y":0.799,"z":0